1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,740
To start things off, I want to ask the question, why?

2
00:00:02,960 --> 00:00:04,780
Why not you bastard?

3
00:00:05,580 --> 00:00:09,320
Seriously, before we spend all the time and money building your personal style,

4
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:11,439
why in the world does it even matter?

5
00:00:11,519 --> 00:00:13,410
Is there a good reason to have a signature style?

6
00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:15,439
But, how about instead of one, I give you four.

7
00:00:15,820 --> 00:00:17,960
Reason number one, first impressions.

8
00:00:18,239 --> 00:00:22,780
Now, I get why this can be confusing because most of us have received a lot of conflicting information here.

9
00:00:22,859 --> 00:00:25,760
We're told by society, don't judge a book by its cover.

10
00:00:26,039 --> 00:00:31,019
Take the time to understand what somebody is about and don't judge them based off appearances.

11
00:00:31,359 --> 00:00:34,539
Now, as a father of five kids, this is something I wholeheartedly embrace.

